1
00:01:27,999 --> 00:01:33,381
[Adapted from Che Ye Liu Xiang's
novel of the same name]

2
00:01:33,381 --> 00:01:38,107
[Episode 1]

3
00:01:41,312 --> 00:01:43,156
[1992, Yunjing]

4
00:01:43,156 --> 00:01:45,281
<i>Lu Xiao Fan once believed</i>

5
00:01:45,281 --> 00:01:48,781
<i>he could stand shoulder to shoulder with him.</i>

6
00:01:48,781 --> 00:01:50,865
<i>But reality told him</i>

7
00:01:50,865 --> 00:01:53,323
<i>it was a pipe dream.</i>

8
00:01:53,323 --> 00:01:56,031
<i>Some people were born on top,</i>

9
00:01:56,031 --> 00:02:00,323
<i>while he, Lu Xiao Fan, was at the bottom.</i>

10
00:02:00,323 --> 00:02:05,615
<i>Those at the bottom
had to live and want accordingly.</i>

11
00:02:05,615 --> 00:02:06,615
<i>Otherwise...</i>

12
00:02:06,615 --> 00:02:07,783
Big Bro.

13
00:02:07,783 --> 00:02:09,240
Long time no see.

14
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:11,004
Have you eaten yet?

15
00:02:11,677 --> 00:02:13,054
Not yet.

16
00:02:14,073 --> 00:02:16,156
How about I take you out to eat?

17
00:02:16,156 --> 00:02:17,623
No need.

18
00:02:28,115 --> 00:02:30,748
So, what brings you here?

19
00:02:31,741 --> 00:02:34,240
Is your family asking for money again?

20
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:37,115
Or is your brother unhappy with his job again?

21
00:02:37,115 --> 00:02:39,456
Or something else?

22
00:02:40,490 --> 00:02:44,448
My mom wants to visit me in Yunjing.

23
00:02:44,448 --> 00:02:47,657
Didn't you head back recently?

24
00:02:47,657 --> 00:02:49,658
If Mrs. Lu misses you,

25
00:02:49,658 --> 00:02:51,581
just go back for another visit.

26
00:02:54,073 --> 00:02:57,290
She also wants to look around in Yunjing.

27
00:02:59,365 --> 00:03:00,406
When they get here,

28
00:03:00,406 --> 00:03:02,081
can't you look after them?

29
00:03:03,615 --> 00:03:07,123
She also wants to see Lv Xin.

30
00:03:08,990 --> 00:03:13,081
How about giving her a call?

31
00:03:20,490 --> 00:03:21,490
All right.

32
00:03:21,490 --> 00:03:22,915
I got it.

33
00:03:27,115 --> 00:03:28,615
Big Bro.

34
00:03:28,615 --> 00:03:30,790
You really won't eat?

35
00:03:32,784 --> 00:03:34,126
I'm not hungry.

36
00:03:36,245 --> 00:03:37,920
Well...

37
00:03:39,281 --> 00:03:40,956
I'm leaving.

38
00:04:13,521 --> 00:04:17,906
[1990, Yunxi]

39
00:04:17,906 --> 00:04:19,156
<i>Fan Fan.</i>

40
00:04:19,156 --> 00:04:22,448
<i>From now on, you're an adult.</i>

41
00:04:22,448 --> 00:04:26,365
<i>You have to understand,
nothing in life is all good,</i>

42
00:04:26,365 --> 00:04:29,077
<i>nor all bad.</i>

43
00:04:30,156 --> 00:04:33,073
<i>The Bei family. Big officials in the capital.</i>

44
00:04:33,073 --> 00:04:36,998
<i>What's up? Marrying into money?</i>

45
00:04:38,198 --> 00:04:41,156
<i>Lu Xiao Ping is the eldest son
of the Lu family.</i>

46
00:04:41,156 --> 00:04:43,990
<i>Having him marry into their family</i>

47
00:04:43,990 --> 00:04:46,073
<i>goes against both reason and custom.</i>

48
00:04:46,073 --> 00:04:47,365
<i>All right then.</i>

49
00:04:47,365 --> 00:04:51,073
<i>In my eyes, Xiao Fan
is a very well-behaved boy.</i>

50
00:04:51,073 --> 00:04:53,706
<i>Fan Fan, come on, call him "Dad."</i>

51
00:05:10,781 --> 00:05:12,831
Who is it?

52
00:05:13,741 --> 00:05:14,865
I...

53
00:05:14,865 --> 00:05:16,865
I didn't know you were in the room.

54
00:05:16,865 --> 00:05:19,073
Don't think marrying me means
a hick like you gets in my bed.

55
00:05:19,073 --> 00:05:20,908
That's not what I meant.

56
00:05:20,908 --> 00:05:23,240
I'll make do on the sofa tonight.

57
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,581
Get out.

58
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:41,114
This time, the Bei family
must give us an answer.

59
00:05:41,114 --> 00:05:42,156
Keep your voice down.

60
00:05:42,156 --> 00:05:43,448
You want everyone to hear you, huh?

61
00:05:43,448 --> 00:05:44,531
The deed's already done.

62
00:05:44,531 --> 00:05:45,740
So what?

63
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:46,781
Call it off.

64
00:05:46,781 --> 00:05:48,490
His daughter has a shady past.

65
00:05:48,490 --> 00:05:50,905
She's carrying an illegitimate child.

66
00:05:50,905 --> 00:05:53,074
The Beis are officials in the capital

67
00:05:53,074 --> 00:05:54,656
and fear a scandal.

68
00:05:54,656 --> 00:05:58,615
Does that mean they can prey on the Lu family?

69
00:05:58,615 --> 00:05:59,990
I knew it.

70
00:05:59,990 --> 00:06:01,365
No wonder he's back in town,

71
00:06:01,365 --> 00:06:03,403
still clinging to this childhood betrothal.

72
00:06:03,403 --> 00:06:05,915
The door isn't closed yet.
Go on, close it! Hurry!

73
00:06:10,198 --> 00:06:11,656
You want the whole village to find out

74
00:06:11,656 --> 00:06:12,740
your daughter-in-law got knocked up

75
00:06:12,740 --> 00:06:14,581
before she even crossed the threshold?

76
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,698
And left your son a cuckold?

77
00:06:17,698 --> 00:06:19,073
If this marriage is called off,

78
00:06:19,073 --> 00:06:20,990
his reputation will be ruined, too.

79
00:06:20,990 --> 00:06:24,281
Lu Zhen Xing, don't think I am as petty as you,

80
00:06:24,281 --> 00:06:26,406
drooling over that 2,000-yuan bride price.

81
00:06:26,406 --> 00:06:28,698
Xiao Fan has been wronged a little,

82
00:06:28,698 --> 00:06:29,740
but it's still better than

83
00:06:29,740 --> 00:06:32,323
rotting in the countryside farming.

84
00:06:32,323 --> 00:06:33,948
Ping Ping is set to graduate.

85
00:06:33,948 --> 00:06:35,156
With the Bei family backing him,

86
00:06:35,156 --> 00:06:38,540
he can get an official post in Yunjing.

87
00:06:39,365 --> 00:06:40,698
And the youngest one,

88
00:06:40,698 --> 00:06:41,699
when she grows up,

89
00:06:41,699 --> 00:06:43,031
she can study in city colleges

90
00:06:43,031 --> 00:06:44,998
and become a city dweller.

91
00:06:46,365 --> 00:06:48,490
All right. Stop moping.

92
00:06:48,490 --> 00:06:49,865
The villagers will come
asking for red envelopes soon.

93
00:06:49,865 --> 00:06:51,040
Let's go.

94
00:07:01,823 --> 00:07:04,498
Hey, why not hit the newlyweds' room?

95
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:07,115
Anybody's fine for red envelopes.

96
00:07:07,115 --> 00:07:09,408
The Lus won't shell out much.

97
00:07:09,408 --> 00:07:11,990
Yo! Isn't this the groom?

98
00:07:11,990 --> 00:07:13,031
Yeah.

99
00:07:13,031 --> 00:07:14,156
Looks like he's had too much.

100
00:07:14,156 --> 00:07:15,781
Doesn't the bride care?

101
00:07:15,781 --> 00:07:18,323
Bet the bride chased him out, huh?

102
00:07:18,323 --> 00:07:19,865
Marrying up is no picnic.

103
00:07:19,865 --> 00:07:21,031
Hey!

104
00:07:21,031 --> 00:07:22,656
They're already married,

105
00:07:22,656 --> 00:07:25,115
and you're still gossiping behind their backs.

106
00:07:25,115 --> 00:07:26,156
Come on, help him up.

107
00:07:26,156 --> 00:07:27,157
Help him up.

108
00:07:27,157 --> 00:07:28,873
Come on, groom.

109
00:07:30,448 --> 00:07:31,573
All right, let's take him back.

110
00:07:31,573 --> 00:07:33,031
The bride didn't even come out to toast today.

111
00:07:33,031 --> 00:07:35,406
- I didn't even get a good look.
- Let's go.

112
00:07:35,406 --> 00:07:37,615
Don't I know you?

113
00:07:37,615 --> 00:07:39,073
Just thinking about that sleazy stuff.

114
00:07:39,073 --> 00:07:40,698
Oh, please. Don't you want to see, too?

115
00:07:40,698 --> 00:07:42,248
Then don't go.

116
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:08,277
Mr. Bei.

117
00:08:11,990 --> 00:08:13,698
Who's this guy, so full of himself?

118
00:08:13,698 --> 00:08:16,165
Eldest son of the Beis, Bei Lv Qing.

119
00:08:16,948 --> 00:08:19,073
<i>Lu Xiao Fan never thought</i>

120
00:08:19,073 --> 00:08:21,948
<i>that trapped in such dire circumstances,</i>

121
00:08:21,948 --> 00:08:25,198
<i>his only saving grace was him,</i>

122
00:08:25,198 --> 00:08:27,373
<i>Bei Lv Xin's older brother.</i>

123
00:08:28,031 --> 00:08:30,240
At that moment, he couldn't foresee

124
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,948
that in the days to come,

125
00:08:31,948 --> 00:08:36,623
this unexpected closeness
would change his entire life.

126
00:08:47,950 --> 00:08:50,081
All right. Drop the act.

127
00:09:02,323 --> 00:09:05,990
Big Bro, you caught me.

128
00:09:05,990 --> 00:09:07,567
Where were you going?

129
00:09:11,242 --> 00:09:13,126
Stay here tonight.

130
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,915
Go take a shower.

131
00:10:54,305 --> 00:10:57,105
Big Bro, I-I'm done.

132
00:10:59,365 --> 00:11:01,165
Done?

133
00:11:09,158 --> 00:11:11,866
Did you forget to wash your hair?

134
00:11:11,866 --> 00:11:14,116
Th-There's no need.

135
00:11:14,116 --> 00:11:16,165
It'd be a waste of water.

136
00:11:19,532 --> 00:11:23,281
<i>Lu Xiao Fan really had no clue
about showering.</i>

137
00:11:23,281 --> 00:11:25,281
<i>Besides, last night, for the wedding,</i>

138
00:11:25,281 --> 00:11:27,531
<i>he had just taken a shower.</i>

139
00:11:27,531 --> 00:11:29,698
<i>Not until Bei Lv Qing went in with him</i>

140
00:11:29,698 --> 00:11:31,865
<i>did Lu Xiao Fan realize</i>

141
00:11:31,865 --> 00:11:33,615
<i>that taking a shower in the city</i>

142
00:11:33,615 --> 00:11:35,698
<i>meant washing from head to toe,</i>

143
00:11:35,698 --> 00:11:39,123
<i>not just a pair of feet.</i>

144
00:12:29,656 --> 00:12:31,365
The left one's for hair,

145
00:12:31,365 --> 00:12:33,581
The right one's for body.

146
00:12:34,198 --> 00:12:36,165
Wash yourself properly.

147
00:12:53,281 --> 00:12:54,948
<i>Don't think marrying me means</i>

148
00:12:54,948 --> 00:12:57,281
<i>a hick like you gets in my bed.</i>

149
00:12:57,281 --> 00:12:58,748
<i>Get out.</i>

150
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:24,240
Big Bro.

151
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,781
What's wrong?

152
00:13:25,781 --> 00:13:27,616
My clothes are all wet.

153
00:13:27,616 --> 00:13:29,540
Just wear mine tomorrow.

154
00:13:31,531 --> 00:13:34,831
They're all wet.

155
00:15:00,657 --> 00:15:01,907
Big Bro.

156
00:15:01,907 --> 00:15:04,581
Can I borrow your cassette player?

157
00:15:05,823 --> 00:15:07,040
Huh?

158
00:15:08,281 --> 00:15:10,115
At the wedding,

159
00:15:10,115 --> 00:15:11,406
my little sister said she wanted to...

160
00:15:11,406 --> 00:15:13,790
I don't have one.

161
00:15:15,990 --> 00:15:17,698
This one here?

162
00:15:17,698 --> 00:15:19,531
It's a CD player.

163
00:15:19,531 --> 00:15:21,740
A CD player?

164
00:15:21,740 --> 00:15:23,156
Got it in Japan.

165
00:15:23,156 --> 00:15:25,573
It's totally normal you haven't seen one.

166
00:15:25,573 --> 00:15:27,081
No.

167
00:15:28,031 --> 00:15:29,573
Never mind.

168
00:15:29,573 --> 00:15:31,281
It's fine.

169
00:15:31,281 --> 00:15:32,948
Give it to your sister tomorrow morning.

170
00:15:32,948 --> 00:15:34,831
We're not leaving until the afternoon.

171
00:16:01,865 --> 00:16:03,498
Smells off.

172
00:16:09,490 --> 00:16:11,623
You swapped them.

173
00:16:21,448 --> 00:16:23,240
I mean,

174
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:26,373
you mixed up the shampoo and body wash.

175
00:17:15,531 --> 00:17:18,033
Xiao Fan's perfect in all respects.

176
00:17:18,033 --> 00:17:19,740
He's just a quiet kid.

177
00:17:19,740 --> 00:17:23,698
From now on, please keep an eye on him.

178
00:17:23,698 --> 00:17:24,741
It's no trouble at all.

179
00:17:24,741 --> 00:17:27,656
He's sensible and well-behaved.

180
00:17:27,656 --> 00:17:29,580
Xiao Fan. Come here.

181
00:17:33,531 --> 00:17:34,573
Once you're over there,

182
00:17:34,573 --> 00:17:37,448
learn from Mr. Bei and his son.

183
00:17:37,448 --> 00:17:39,365
Don't worry, Mrs. Lu.

184
00:17:39,365 --> 00:17:41,740
Call us when you get there.

185
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:43,323
Xiao Fan isn't that dim-witted.

186
00:17:43,323 --> 00:17:44,656
He won't forget his big brother.

187
00:17:44,656 --> 00:17:46,081
Right?

188
00:17:48,282 --> 00:17:50,323
Sis.

189
00:17:50,323 --> 00:17:52,115
Where's Big Bro Bei's CD player?

190
00:17:52,115 --> 00:17:53,282
Mom.

191
00:17:53,282 --> 00:17:55,948
I-I broke the CD player.

192
00:17:55,948 --> 00:17:57,115
How could you?

193
00:17:57,115 --> 00:17:59,573
How could you break Big Bro Bei's things?

194
00:17:59,573 --> 00:18:00,781
Give me the player, quick.

195
00:18:00,781 --> 00:18:02,573
I'll head into town to get it fixed.

196
00:18:02,573 --> 00:18:03,990
Hurry up and get it out!

197
00:18:03,990 --> 00:18:06,323
It's gone.

198
00:18:06,323 --> 00:18:07,366
It's gone?

199
00:18:07,366 --> 00:18:08,407
It was already broken.

200
00:18:08,407 --> 00:18:09,491
I wasn't paying attention,

201
00:18:09,491 --> 00:18:11,531
and someone must have taken it.

202
00:18:11,531 --> 00:18:14,865
How could you lose the player?

203
00:18:14,865 --> 00:18:15,948
What's the big deal?

204
00:18:15,948 --> 00:18:16,950
I'll give you money.

205
00:18:16,950 --> 00:18:18,698
When you arrive in Yunjing,
get Bei Lv Qing another one.

206
00:18:18,698 --> 00:18:19,700
Mom.

207
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:21,031
It's just a CD player.

208
00:18:21,031 --> 00:18:22,448
My brother married their daughter.

209
00:18:22,448 --> 00:18:23,823
Consider it a gift for me.

210
00:18:23,823 --> 00:18:24,906
It can't be worth much anyway.

211
00:18:24,906 --> 00:18:26,498
Watch your mouth.

212
00:18:29,115 --> 00:18:30,366
No matter how valuable your son is,

213
00:18:30,366 --> 00:18:32,073
you can only sell him once.

214
00:18:32,073 --> 00:18:34,156
Didn't you just get 2,000 in bride price?

215
00:18:34,156 --> 00:18:36,573
My brother's player cost 3,000.

216
00:18:36,573 --> 00:18:38,781
It was a birthday gift from my mom.

217
00:18:38,781 --> 00:18:41,781
Offer to pay? He might not take it.

218
00:18:41,781 --> 00:18:43,073
Even if he does,

219
00:18:43,073 --> 00:18:44,865
your son won't cut it.

220
00:18:44,865 --> 00:18:47,115
You'd still owe a thousand more.

221
00:18:47,115 --> 00:18:48,156
You wretched child!

222
00:18:48,156 --> 00:18:50,198
- Mom.
- Lv Xin, watch your mouth!

223
00:18:50,198 --> 00:18:52,823
Is that any way to talk to your elders?

224
00:18:52,823 --> 00:18:54,406
- Mom.
- Say no more!

225
00:18:54,406 --> 00:18:55,740
All right, all right.

226
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:58,240
Forget it, you're making a fool of yourself.

227
00:18:58,240 --> 00:18:59,415
Come here.

228
00:19:00,698 --> 00:19:01,865
In-law.

229
00:19:01,865 --> 00:19:03,573
Sorry you had to see that.

230
00:19:03,573 --> 00:19:05,490
But if you don't teach a daughter yourself,

231
00:19:05,490 --> 00:19:07,198
she'll grow up to be a menace.

232
00:19:07,198 --> 00:19:08,781
And if she has no shame,

233
00:19:08,781 --> 00:19:12,290
it reflects poorly
on us parents, too, doesn't it?

234
00:19:13,156 --> 00:19:15,498
You're right.

235
00:19:16,490 --> 00:19:19,123
As for the CD player...

236
00:19:19,990 --> 00:19:21,531
It's not really worth much.

237
00:19:21,531 --> 00:19:23,331
If it's lost, so be it.

238
00:19:24,406 --> 00:19:26,698
Go on, thank him.

239
00:19:26,698 --> 00:19:28,073
Xiao Fan is my brother-in-law.

240
00:19:28,073 --> 00:19:29,323
We're all family.

241
00:19:29,323 --> 00:19:30,823
That CD player...

242
00:19:30,823 --> 00:19:32,615
I lent it to him since we're relatives.

243
00:19:32,615 --> 00:19:35,365
So, naturally it's on him.

244
00:19:35,365 --> 00:19:37,165
Thank you, Big Bro Bei.

245
00:19:39,115 --> 00:19:42,656
<i>Mrs. Lu made the wedding
really grand this time.</i>

246
00:19:42,656 --> 00:19:44,365
<i>But Lu Xiao Fan knew</i>

247
00:19:44,365 --> 00:19:47,531
<i>she didn't use up all the bride price.</i>

248
00:19:47,531 --> 00:19:49,031
<i>Mrs. Lu greeted the guests.</i>

249
00:19:49,031 --> 00:19:51,948
<i>She also took the red envelopes.</i>

250
00:19:51,948 --> 00:19:54,156
<i>But his sister lost Bei Lv Qing's CD player,</i>

251
00:19:54,156 --> 00:19:56,165
<i>yet she refused to shell out a cent.</i>

252
00:19:56,823 --> 00:19:58,781
<i>Whenever Lu Xiao Fan thought of this,</i>

253
00:19:58,781 --> 00:20:01,281
<i>he felt utterly inferior.</i>

254
00:20:01,281 --> 00:20:02,490
<i>Thinking of Bei Lv Qing,</i>

255
00:20:02,490 --> 00:20:05,073
<i>who must look down on their entire family,</i>

256
00:20:05,073 --> 00:20:08,531
<i>Lu Xiao Fan felt even more inferior.</i>

257
00:20:08,531 --> 00:20:09,873
Mom.

258
00:20:11,198 --> 00:20:12,498
Dad.

259
00:20:15,656 --> 00:20:17,656
I'll be off then.

260
00:20:17,656 --> 00:20:18,906
Take care.

261
00:20:18,906 --> 00:20:21,498
- Look after yourself, okay?
- Yeah.

262
00:21:09,198 --> 00:21:11,448
Wait.

263
00:21:11,448 --> 00:21:14,156
Wait, Xiao Fan.

264
00:21:14,156 --> 00:21:17,115
Xiao Fan, wait!

265
00:21:17,115 --> 00:21:19,031
Hold on.

266
00:21:19,031 --> 00:21:21,665
- Stop the car.
- What are you doing?

267
00:21:25,698 --> 00:21:27,281
Fan Fan.

268
00:21:27,281 --> 00:21:28,490
Mom.

269
00:21:28,490 --> 00:21:29,740
Mom. What's wrong?

270
00:21:29,740 --> 00:21:32,531
Here. Fan Fan, quick, put it away.

271
00:21:32,531 --> 00:21:33,656
Hide it well.

272
00:21:33,656 --> 00:21:35,531
If anything comes up once you arrive,

273
00:21:35,531 --> 00:21:37,991
call the township chief's house
and give me a ring.

274
00:21:37,991 --> 00:21:40,157
If the Bei family dares to treat you badly,

275
00:21:40,157 --> 00:21:42,873
don't worry, I'll deal with them.

276
00:21:46,281 --> 00:21:47,324
Mom, you keep it.

277
00:21:47,324 --> 00:21:48,406
I can't take this.

278
00:21:48,406 --> 00:21:50,948
- Quick.
- I can't, you keep it.

279
00:21:50,948 --> 00:21:52,540
Hurry, take it.

280
00:21:55,823 --> 00:21:57,573
Mrs. Lu, don't worry.

281
00:21:57,573 --> 00:21:59,748
We'll take good care of Fan Fan.

282
00:22:00,490 --> 00:22:02,449
All right, all right.

283
00:22:02,449 --> 00:22:04,613
Go on back.

284
00:22:29,031 --> 00:22:31,956
Can't bear to leave your mom? Stay behind then.

285
00:22:39,865 --> 00:22:42,781
<i>Lu Xiao Fan, the second of four children,</i>

286
00:22:42,781 --> 00:22:45,998
<i>was always the one easily overlooked.</i>

287
00:22:46,656 --> 00:22:48,115
<i>He knew he paled in comparison</i>

288
00:22:48,115 --> 00:22:50,073
<i>to talkative Lu Xiao Ping.</i>

289
00:22:50,073 --> 00:22:52,948
<i>So, he never complained.</i>

290
00:22:52,948 --> 00:22:54,990
<i>But who hasn't dreamed</i>

291
00:22:54,990 --> 00:22:56,032
<i>that somewhere in this world</i>

292
00:22:56,032 --> 00:22:58,582
<i>there might be someone who favors them?</i>

293
00:22:59,323 --> 00:23:01,415
<i>Maybe there really was.</i>

294
00:23:49,379 --> 00:23:53,962
[Bei's Residence, Yunjing]

295
00:23:57,990 --> 00:24:01,031
<i>Stepping into the Bei household,</i>

296
00:24:01,031 --> 00:24:05,498
<i>Lu Xiao Fan felt like
a country boy in the big city.</i>

297
00:24:06,448 --> 00:24:09,531
<i>It felt like a place to be revered,</i>

298
00:24:09,531 --> 00:24:11,790
<i>not a home.</i>

299
00:24:16,656 --> 00:24:21,490
<i>Perhaps he never truly outgrew that feeling.</i>

300
00:24:21,490 --> 00:24:22,865
Hey.

301
00:24:22,865 --> 00:24:24,281
Hello.

302
00:24:24,281 --> 00:24:27,448
You're Lu Xiao Fan, aren't you?

303
00:24:27,448 --> 00:24:28,906
No need to be so nervous.

304
00:24:28,906 --> 00:24:31,531
I run the Bei household. I'm Lin.

305
00:24:31,531 --> 00:24:34,865
Just like Lv Xin and the rest,
call me "Aunt Lin."

306
00:24:34,865 --> 00:24:36,323
- Hello, Aunt Lin.
- Oh my, oh my.

307
00:24:36,323 --> 00:24:37,531
All right, all right.

308
00:24:37,531 --> 00:24:39,448
There's no need for that. Come, follow me.

309
00:24:39,448 --> 00:24:40,615
Okay.

310
00:24:40,615 --> 00:24:44,490
It's not mealtime yet,
but help yourself if you're hungry.

311
00:24:44,490 --> 00:24:46,531
Never used one before?

312
00:24:46,531 --> 00:24:47,698
Think of it like a root cellar.

313
00:24:47,698 --> 00:24:49,240
Make sure you shut the door tight.

314
00:24:49,240 --> 00:24:50,990
This is Mr. Bei's study.

315
00:24:50,990 --> 00:24:52,948
Don't enter unless needed, and knock first.

316
00:24:52,948 --> 00:24:54,156
Okay.

317
00:24:54,156 --> 00:24:55,781
Mr. Lv Qing likes to have academic discussions

318
00:24:55,781 --> 00:24:57,990
with his classmates in this little garden.

319
00:24:57,990 --> 00:24:59,323
Don't disturb them for no reason.

320
00:24:59,323 --> 00:25:02,748
Don't go into Lv Xin
and Lv Qing's rooms for no reason.

321
00:25:08,198 --> 00:25:10,373
This is your room.

322
00:25:10,990 --> 00:25:12,365
Don't mind the size.

323
00:25:12,365 --> 00:25:14,740
It's really bright inside.

324
00:25:14,740 --> 00:25:15,782
No, not at all.

325
00:25:15,782 --> 00:25:19,081
It's bigger than my room at home.

326
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:22,781
Well, you rest up.

327
00:25:22,781 --> 00:25:24,656
Aunt Lin.

328
00:25:24,656 --> 00:25:25,990
Well...

329
00:25:25,990 --> 00:25:27,615
Lv Xin, she...

330
00:25:27,615 --> 00:25:28,865
Xiao Fan.

331
00:25:28,865 --> 00:25:31,448
The Bei family is no ordinary household.

332
00:25:31,448 --> 00:25:34,656
I don't know what your life was like before.

333
00:25:34,656 --> 00:25:35,990
Now that you're here,

334
00:25:35,990 --> 00:25:37,448
you have to learn to adapt.

335
00:25:37,448 --> 00:25:40,240
Don't ask questions you shouldn't.

336
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:42,248
The Bei family will take care of you.

337
00:25:44,990 --> 00:25:47,040
Rest now, okay?

338
00:26:16,656 --> 00:26:18,290
<i>Wait.</i>

339
00:26:18,948 --> 00:26:21,448
<i>Wait, Xiao Fan.</i>

340
00:26:21,448 --> 00:26:25,990
<i>The Lu family must seize
this golden opportunity.</i>

341
00:26:25,990 --> 00:26:28,781
<i>But Xiao Fan couldn't help thinking.</i>

342
00:26:28,781 --> 00:26:30,448
<i>Lv Xin was already pregnant.</i>

343
00:26:30,448 --> 00:26:32,240
<i>Here. Hide it well.</i>

344
00:26:32,240 --> 00:26:34,198
<i>If the Bei family dares to treat you badly,</i>

345
00:26:34,198 --> 00:26:35,740
<i>I'll deal with them.</i>

346
00:26:35,740 --> 00:26:37,115
<i>About this matter...</i>

347
00:26:37,115 --> 00:26:40,331
<i>Why wouldn't his parents tell him directly?</i>

348
00:26:43,490 --> 00:26:46,906
<i>Lu Xiao Fan, a mediocre and useless man,</i>

349
00:26:46,906 --> 00:26:49,531
<i>marrying a city girl,</i>

350
00:26:49,531 --> 00:26:51,615
<i>having a high-ranking official
as a father-in-law,</i>

351
00:26:51,615 --> 00:26:54,781
<i>and a big boss as a mother-in-law...</i>

352
00:26:54,781 --> 00:26:58,623
<i>All of this was the best repayment
Xiao Fan could give his parents.</i>

353
00:26:59,490 --> 00:27:02,573
<i>But within the Bei household,</i>

354
00:27:02,573 --> 00:27:05,915
<i>where exactly did Xiao Fan stand?</i>

355
00:27:11,699 --> 00:27:13,115
Hey. Hold on.

356
00:27:13,115 --> 00:27:14,656
Place a mat under hot dishes.

357
00:27:14,656 --> 00:27:16,956
It's a rosewood table.

358
00:27:24,198 --> 00:27:26,031
Xiao Fan got up early with nothing to do,

359
00:27:26,031 --> 00:27:28,206
and insisted on learning to cook from me.

360
00:27:31,047 --> 00:27:32,389
Big Bro.

361
00:27:33,167 --> 00:27:35,050
Lv Xin, she...

362
00:27:36,906 --> 00:27:38,323
Lu Xiao Fan.

363
00:27:38,323 --> 00:27:39,406
You've shot to the top overnight,

364
00:27:39,406 --> 00:27:41,915
so why still act like a hick?

365
00:27:47,323 --> 00:27:49,073
Xiao Fan.

366
00:27:49,073 --> 00:27:51,073
Don't bother with anything else today.

367
00:27:51,073 --> 00:27:52,956
Dad has something to tell you.

368
00:27:57,990 --> 00:27:59,415
Xiao Fan.

369
00:28:00,323 --> 00:28:02,831
Any ideas of your own?

370
00:28:06,365 --> 00:28:07,906
I...

371
00:28:07,906 --> 00:28:10,198
I'm fine with any task.

372
00:28:10,198 --> 00:28:12,206
I just don't want to be idle.

373
00:28:13,490 --> 00:28:17,073
What I mean is, pick up your studies tomorrow.

374
00:28:17,073 --> 00:28:18,623
First, take the college entrance exam.

375
00:28:19,698 --> 00:28:22,615
N-No need for all that trouble.

376
00:28:22,615 --> 00:28:25,323
Studying takes time.

377
00:28:25,323 --> 00:28:27,156
I can do any kind of work.

378
00:28:27,156 --> 00:28:29,031
Back home I could carry bags of wheat

379
00:28:29,031 --> 00:28:31,956
and make several trips to town.

380
00:28:32,783 --> 00:28:34,198
It's fine.

381
00:28:34,198 --> 00:28:36,948
Since I made a promise to Mrs. Lu,
I'll see it through.

382
00:28:36,948 --> 00:28:39,406
A few years of studying is nothing to fear.

383
00:28:39,406 --> 00:28:43,081
Mr. Bei, really, don't go to such trouble.

384
00:28:43,990 --> 00:28:45,573
I didn't even finish middle school.

385
00:28:45,573 --> 00:28:47,456
There's no way I'll pass.

386
00:28:49,698 --> 00:28:52,156
You are the Bei family's son-in-law.

387
00:28:52,156 --> 00:28:53,865
The Beis need to keep our reputation,

388
00:28:53,865 --> 00:28:56,240
so you must act accordingly.

389
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:57,873
Understood?

390
00:28:59,656 --> 00:29:02,248
Just hire a home tutor then.

391
00:29:04,615 --> 00:29:06,415
I'll teach him.

392
00:29:12,073 --> 00:29:14,740
Xiao Fan, just learn from Lv Qing.

393
00:29:14,740 --> 00:29:16,198
Don't feel pressured.

394
00:29:16,198 --> 00:29:18,206
Just make the cutoff score.

395
00:29:27,365 --> 00:29:28,748
Big Bro.

396
00:29:35,156 --> 00:29:36,623
Try it on.

397
00:29:46,240 --> 00:29:47,573
Big Bro, there's no need for this.

398
00:29:47,573 --> 00:29:49,281
I brought plenty of clothes.

399
00:29:49,281 --> 00:29:50,706
Try it on.

400
00:29:51,531 --> 00:29:53,790
If it doesn't fit, I'll exchange it.

401
00:30:42,948 --> 00:30:44,456
Get up.

402
00:30:50,615 --> 00:30:52,165
Turn around.

403
00:30:57,156 --> 00:30:58,281
Big Bro.

404
00:30:58,281 --> 00:31:00,115
It's a perfect fit.

405
00:31:00,115 --> 00:31:02,165
You're amazing.

406
00:31:03,615 --> 00:31:05,948
Try on some pants, too.

407
00:31:05,948 --> 00:31:07,123
Okay.

408
00:31:09,573 --> 00:31:11,448
Back in the Lu household,

409
00:31:11,448 --> 00:31:14,906
<i>Xiao Fan wore nothing
but his elder brother's hand-me-downs.</i>

410
00:31:14,906 --> 00:31:16,781
<i>Facing Bei Lv Qing's kindness,</i>

411
00:31:16,781 --> 00:31:18,990
<i>Xiao Fan couldn't help but wonder</i>

412
00:31:18,990 --> 00:31:21,956
<i>what could he possibly give in return?</i>

413
00:32:06,490 --> 00:32:08,323
Big Bro.

414
00:32:08,323 --> 00:32:12,081
The pants are a bit tight.

415
00:32:14,281 --> 00:32:16,165
You'll get used to them.

416
00:32:39,156 --> 00:32:40,365
Get some sleep.

417
00:32:40,365 --> 00:32:42,081
I'll start teaching you tomorrow.

418
00:32:53,323 --> 00:32:55,156
Big Bro.

419
00:32:55,156 --> 00:32:57,165
Maybe let's just forget it.

420
00:33:00,948 --> 00:33:02,573
You'd better go for the arts.

421
00:33:02,573 --> 00:33:03,906
Physics, Chemistry, and Biology

422
00:33:03,906 --> 00:33:06,115
are really tough to start from scratch.

423
00:33:06,115 --> 00:33:09,031
Big Bro, aren't you a science major?

424
00:33:09,031 --> 00:33:12,290
I can teach you the arts as well.

425
00:33:18,656 --> 00:33:20,456
This CD player is for you.

426
00:33:21,156 --> 00:33:22,323
Your English is not great.

427
00:33:22,323 --> 00:33:24,156
You'll need it later.

428
00:33:24,156 --> 00:33:25,615
No, it's okay.

429
00:33:25,615 --> 00:33:27,198
It's too expensive.

430
00:33:27,198 --> 00:33:29,040
I won't need it.

